---
import BaseLayout from '../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms and conditions for using rebeccanorrington.com and Rebecca L. Norrington's services."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 bg-cream-dark">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-charcoal-light">Last updated: {new Date().getFullYear()}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="space-y-8 text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-charcoal mb-3">Use of This Website</h2>
        <p>By accessing this website, you agree to use it for lawful purposes only. You may not use this site in any way that violates applicable laws or infringes on the rights of others.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-charcoal mb-3">Services</h2>
        <p>Rebecca L. Norrington offers coaching, classes, retreats, and related services as described on this website. All services are subject to availability and Rebecca's discretion. Specific terms for each service will be communicated at the time of booking.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-charcoal mb-3">Donations</h2>
        <p>Donations made via PayPal are voluntary and non-refundable. They are made in support of Rebecca's work and mission and do not constitute payment for specific services.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-charcoal mb-3">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content on this website — including text, images, and materials — is the property of Rebecca L. Norrington unless otherwise stated. You may not reproduce or distribute this content without explicit written permission.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-charcoal mb-3">Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>Rebecca's coaching and teachings are not a substitute for professional medical or psychological treatment. If you are experiencing a mental health crisis, please seek qualified professional help.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-charcoal mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Contact Rebecca at <a href="mailto:rln@rebeccanorrington.com" class="text-terracotta underline">rln@rebeccanorrington.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
